<p class="clause-body" style="margin-top:6px;">
    6.4&#160;&#160;The Parties agree that the amount of the Commission and the Administration Fee are
    exclusive of any VAT (if applicable).
</p>

<p class="section-num" style="margin-top:16px;">7.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Termination:</p>

<p class="clause-body">
    7.1.&#160;&#160;Either Party may give 14 (fourteen) days&#8217; written notice to the other Party and on
    expiry of such notice this Agreement will terminate.
</p>

<p class="clause-body" style="margin-top:5px;">
    7.2.&#160;&#160;<span class="underline">Termination of this Agreement shall not prejudice any rights
    of the Broker to the Commissions or Administration Fees accruing up until the date of
    termination.</span>
</p>

<p class="clause-body" style="margin-top:5px;">
    7.3.&#160;&#160;Upon termination of this Agreement the Broker will provide the Developer with a list
    of all Buyers that were identified during the Term of this Agreement as a result of any
    introduction, referral, direction or nomination made by the Broker, as sufficiently evidenced by
    email correspondence in writing.
</p>

<p class="section-num" style="margin-top:16px;">8.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Confidentiality:</p>

<p class="clause-body">
    8.1.&#160;&#160;The Parties agree that they will consider all information furnished by either Party to
    the other Party as confidential no matter the simplicity of the information, including financial
    information, names and nationalities, and any other information related to the transaction and
    subject to this Agreement.
</p>

<p class="clause-body" style="margin-top:5px;">
    8.2.&#160;&#160;Any information containing personal data shall be handled in accordance with all
    privacy laws and regulations applicable in the United Arab Emirates during the Term of this
    Agreement.
</p>

<p class="section-num" style="margin-top:16px;">9.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Assignment and Sub-Contracting:</p>

<p class="clause-body">
    Neither Party may assign, sub-license, transfer, create a charge over or otherwise dispose of
    any of its rights or sub-contract, transfer or otherwise dispose of any of its obligations under
    this Agreement without the prior written consent of the other Party.
</p>

<p class="section-num" style="margin-top:16px;">10.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Further Assurance:</p>

<p class="clause-body">
    Each Party undertakes, at the request and cost and expense of the other Party, to sign all
    documents and to do all other acts, which may be necessary to give full effect to this Agreement.
</p>

